{
  "id": "PRO.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 24",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be envious of evil people, and don't try to make friends with them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Causing trouble is all they ever think about; every time they open their mouth someone is going to be hurt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Homes are built on the foundation of wisdom and understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Homes",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "understanding",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "It takes care to lay the foundations of a house, and skill to build it.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where there is knowledge, the rooms are furnished with valuable, beautiful things.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Being wise is better than being strong;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Being wise is better than being strong",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A person is wise in strength.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yes, knowledge is more important than strength. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, you must make careful plans before you fight a battle, and the more good advice you get, the more likely you are to win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wise sayings are too deep for stupid people to understand. They have nothing to say when important matters are being discussed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you are always planning evil, you will earn a reputation as a troublemaker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any scheme a fool thinks up is sinful. People hate a person who has nothing but scorn for others.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you are weak in a crisis, you are weak indeed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't hesitate to rescue someone who is about to be executed unjustly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You may say that it is none of your business, but God knows and judges your motives. He keeps watch on you; he knows. And he will reward you according to what you do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son, eat honey; it is good. And just as honey from the comb is sweet on your tongue, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "you may be sure that wisdom is good for the soul. Get wisdom and you have a bright future.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be like the wicked who scheme to rob honest people or to take away their homes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No matter how often honest people fall, they always get up again; but disaster destroys the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be glad when your enemies meet disaster, and don't rejoice when they stumble. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will know if you are gloating, and he will not like it; and then he might not punish them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't let evil people worry you; don't be envious of them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wicked person has no future — nothing to look forward to.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have reverence for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", my child, and honour the king. Have nothing to do with people who rebel against them; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "such people could be ruined in a moment. Do you realize the disaster that God or the king can cause?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wise have also said these things:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is wrong for judges to be prejudiced. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If they pronounce a guilty person innocent, they will be cursed and hated by everyone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Judges who punish the guilty, however, will be prosperous and enjoy a good reputation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An honest answer is a sign of true friendship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't build your house and establish a home until your fields are ready, and you are sure that you can earn a living.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't give evidence against someone else without good reason, or say misleading things about him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't say, “I'll do to him just what he did to me! I'll get even with him!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I walked through the fields and vineyards of a lazy, stupid person. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were full of thorn bushes and overgrown with weeds. The stone wall round them had fallen down. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I looked at this, thought about it, and learned a lesson from it: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.6.10+PRO.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Prov 6.10–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "have a nap and sleep if you want to. Fold your hands and rest awhile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 24:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but while you are asleep, poverty will attack you like an armed robber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.24.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.24.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
